# No duplicate logic

Scattered copies are not Google quality. Meaningless SEO paths in `src` are the symptom.

- **SEO / nested pages:** `crumb`, `seoMeta`, `seoPath`, `seoFrom` live in `src/plugins/websiteClient.ts` only. Do not redefine them in toolboxes.
- Paths are one-word nested segments (`seoPath`), parents first, three deep — catalogue rule. Do not invent parallel trees (`/plugins/<hex>`, `/quantum/<tool>/<hex>`) beside the catalogue.
- One concept → one function (see `one-word.mdc`). If you are about to paste a helper, import the existing one.
- Wrong or duplicate meaning on MCP is a security issue (see `entropy.mdc`).
